  <title xml:lang="EN">Establishing a national Computer Security Incident Responce Team in South Africa</title>
  <description xml:lang="EN">CSIR (Council of Scientific Research) and FICORA (Finnish Communications Regulatory Authority) are starting up an ICI-project with the aim of establishing a national Computer Security Incident Responce Team (CSIRT)in South Africa. The sub-objectives include building the capacity of CSIR to run a CSIRT, creating strong domestic and international relations in CSIR regarding CSIRT activities and to develop the capacity of CSIR&apos;s CSIRT personnel.</description>
